あれば。","ts":"1632199744.414000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IYSh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"efd1f6b0-67ed-4a24-b558-2c7d1c7fcd20","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Signature が変わって揉めたケースはどっかで見た記憶があるんですが失念しました","ts":"1632199685.413100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KVm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"684cda06-7350-4064-96ad-380285dfc767","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"「Reflection の結果が変わるなら互換性は壊れる」は「Go 1 ポリシー的にはだめ」とは限らない","ts":"1632199652.412800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jvfh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"74eb3e0c-9675-4c26-bc75-31bf45be2123","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"\u0026gt; なので「Reflection の結果が変わるなら互換性は壊れる」は「Go 1 ポリシー的にはだめ」ではない、と。\nこの文を全否定の文だと読んでしまった","ts":"1632199614.412600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Try24"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db3013ef-27dc-419e-b6a0-f6ce7579164b","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"ああなるほど","ts":"1632199589.412200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0ocj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0336e0f5-f398-4945-806b-3e50f0a5931a","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"reflection全体がそうであるかのように(限定せずに)言えば明らかに間違いである、という指摘です。","ts":"1632199549.411800","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1632199560.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qw6E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e578b5cf-9856-4fd4-9c0f-5bf3a1aa784d","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"いいかたのもんだいで","ts":"1632199519.411100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jtBD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f6b32d5c-d632-48cf-a96b-e4c180cc1abd","type":"messag